{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016SmGzmxmW2PTBHgQMqaQ3g","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# JQ Syntax Generator\n2\t\n3\t## Goal\n4\tBuild a browser-based tool where a user pastes JSON, clicks any element in the rendered tree, and the correct `jq` filter path is generated automatically.\n5\t\n6\t## Scope\n7\t- **In scope:** JSON tree rendering, click-to-path generation, copy-to-clipboard, Node.js HTTP server to serve the single-page app\n8\t- **In scope:** Support for nested objects, arrays (index notation), and mixed structures\n9\t- **Out of scope:** Full jq expression builder (filters, pipes, `select`, `map`) — path generation only\n10\t- **Out of scope:** Remote JSON fetching or authentication\n11\t\n12\t## Getting Started\n13\tTBD — fill in once prototype is scaffolded.\n14\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"94a4313b-6221-4e8f-a88e-c12acac2a892","uuid":"032da14b-7fae-4c13-9bf0-a44e3b7f20a0","timestamp":"2026-04-23T04:06:15.800Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/sysoper/workspace/WhileISleep/batch-output/jq-syntax-generator/README.md","content":"# JQ Syntax Generator\n\n## Goal\nBuild a browser-based tool where a user pastes JSON, clicks any element in the rendered tree, and the correct `jq` filter path is generated automatically.\n\n## Scope\n- **In scope:** JSON tree rendering, click-to-path generation, copy-to-clipboard, Node.js HTTP server to serve the single-page app\n- **In scope:** Support for nested objects, arrays (index notation), and mixed structures\n- **Out of scope:** Full jq expression builder (filters, pipes, `select`, `map`) — path generation only\n- **Out of scope:** Remote JSON fetching or authentication\n\n## Getting Started\nTBD — fill in once prototype is scaffolded.\n","numLines":14,"startLine":1,"totalLines":14}}}
