{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_01L95oX3FBV8321DEi8G2C1y","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01XSgyr8ZipKv55HEoY1qYqD","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/home/sysoper/workspace/WhileISleep/batch-output/jq-syntax-generator/README.md","old_string":"## Getting Started\nTBD — fill in once prototype is scaffolded.","new_string":"## Getting Started\n\n### Run locally\n\n```bash\nnode server.js\n# open http://localhost:3000\n```\n\n### Run tests\n\n```bash\nnode test.js\n```\n\n### Docker\n\n```bash\ndocker build -t jq-syntax-generator .\ndocker run --rm -p 3000:3000 jq-syntax-generator node server.js\n# open http://localhost:3000\n```\n\n## Files\n\n| File | Purpose |\n|---|---|\n| `server.js` | Minimal `http` server — serves `index.html` on `GET /` |\n| `index.html` | Full SPA: JSON textarea, clickable tree, jq path display + copy, path test |\n| `test.js` | 26 unit tests for path builder and evaluator, plus server integration test |\n| `Dockerfile` | `node:22-alpine` image; `CMD node test.js` verifies the build |\n\n## Status\n\n**Build: PASSING** — 26/26 unit tests pass, server integration test passes.\n\n## To do\n\n- [ ] Add collapse-all / expand-all tree controls\n- [ ] Support very large JSON files (virtual scrolling)\n- [ ] Allow clicking leaf values to copy value (not just path)\n- [ ] Keyboard navigation through the tree"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":119,"cache_read_input_tokens":44153,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":119},"output_tokens":55,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"94a4313b-6221-4e8f-a88e-c12acac2a892","uuid":"1208fd90-9af8-4579-95bd-372e0fa7d01e"}
