board, Node.js HTTP server to serve the single-page app\n- **In scope:** Support for nested objects, arrays (index notation), and mixed structures\n- **Out of scope:** Full jq expression builder (filters, pipes, `select`, `map`) — path generation only\n- **Out of scope:** Remote JSON fetching or authentication\n\n## Getting Started\nTBD — fill in once prototype is scaffolded.\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":10,"oldLines":4,"newStart":10,"newLines":44,"lines":[" - **Out of scope:** Remote JSON fetching or authentication"," "," ## Getting Started","-TBD — fill in once prototype is scaffolded.","+","+### Run locally","+","+```bash","+node server.js","+# open http://localhost:3000","+```","+","+### Run tests","+","+```bash","+node test.js","+```","+","+### Docker","+","+```bash","+docker build -t jq-syntax-generator .","+docker run --rm -p 3000:3000 jq-syntax-generator node server.js","+# open http://localhost:3000","+```","+","+## Files","+","+| File | Purpose |","+|---|---|","+| `server.js` | Minimal `http` server — serves `index.html` on `GET /` |","+| `index.html` | Full SPA: JSON textarea, clickable tree, jq path display + copy, path test |","+| `test.js` | 26 unit tests for path builder and evaluator, plus server integration test |","+| `Dockerfile` | `node:22-alpine` image; `CMD node test.js` verifies the build |","+","+## Status","+","+**Build: PASSING** — 26/26 unit tests pass, server integration test passes.","+","+## To do","+","+- [ ] Add collapse-all / expand-all tree controls","+- [ ] Support very large JSON files (virtual scrolling)","+- [ ] Allow clicking leaf values to copy value (not just path)","+- [ ] Keyboard navigation through the tree"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_01YT2Hz1YXqekrYwRw5tZA7v","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Build succeeded. Here's what was created:\n\n**Files:**\n- `server.js` — 35-line `http`+`fs` server, no dependencies\n- `index.html` — self-contained SPA with JSON textarea, recursive clickable tree, jq path field with copy button, and live path-test panel showing the resolved value\n- `test.js` — 26 unit tests (path builder + evaluator) plus a server integration test that starts `server.js` and makes a real HTTP request\n- `Dockerfile` / `.dockerignore`\n\n**Key behavior:**\n- Object keys that are valid identifiers → `.key`; keys with spaces/special chars → `.[\"key with spaces\"]`\n- Array indices → `.[0]`\n- Clicking any node populates the path field and runs the evaluator to show the resolved value (the \"test\" feature)\n- Copy button uses `navigator.clipboard` with a `document.execCommand` fallback\n- JSON parse errors surface inline in the UI, never swallowed\n- \"Load sample\" button pre-fills a nested example including a key-with-spaces to demonstrate bracket notation"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":511,"cache_read_input_tokens":44272,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":511},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"94a4313b-6221-4e8f-a88e-c12acac2a892","uuid":"be48cdb4-6d5e-4452-a476-2a47aa9689ba"}
